      "seed": 36,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Google OAuth button is PRIMARY (blue, prominent) on both /live and /login\n\n2. /live page: \"or enter manually\" divider is CLICKABLE - expands to show name/email fields\n   - Default state: Only Google button visible (simplest)\n   - Manual form is progressive disclosure (reduces clutter)\n\n3. Consent checkbox ALWAYS visible (non-negotiable, shown before any auth action)\n\n4. /login page: Both options visible (no collapsing) - straightforward for returning users\n\n5. Copy: \"Continue with Google\" (not \"Sign in\" or \"Login\") - works for both new + returning\n\n6. NO Google OAuth on /sign-pledge page (keeps pledge signup thoughtful and intentional)\n\n7. NO settings page for linking Google (Supabase auto-links, KISS approach)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 174,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Google OAuth button is PRIMARY (blue, prominent) on both /live and /login\n\n2. /live page: \"or enter manually\" divider is CLICKABLE - expands to show name/email fields\n   - Default state: Only Google button visible (simplest)\n   - Manual form is progressive disclosure (reduces clutter)\n\n3. Consent checkbox ALWAYS visible (non-negotiable, shown before any auth action)\n\n4. /login page: Both options visible (no collapsing) - straightforward for returning users\n\n5. Copy: \"Continue with Google\" (not \"Sign in\" or \"Login\") - works for both new + returning\n\n6. NO Google OAuth on /sign-pledge page (keeps pledge signup thoughtful and intentional)\n\n7. NO settings page for linking Google (Supabase auto-links, KISS approach)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
